    <bpmn:process id="W_W3930" name="W3930. AI/ML Policy, Standards &amp; Risk Appetite" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Strategy (W3929); new AI use-case; regulatory change
Frequency: Annual + on change
Volume: 1 AI policy + standards library
Owner: AI Governance / Risk / Legal
Participants: AI Governance, Risk (links to VS-21), Legal (links to VS-100), Privacy (links to VS-91), Security (links to VS-27.3), HR (links to VS-19), business AI owners, Compliance (links to VS-22)
Source: workflow W3930 — AI/ML Policy, Standards &amp; Risk Appetite</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W3930_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W3930_Lane1" name="AI Governance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3930_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3930_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3930_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3930_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W3930_End7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W3930_Start3" name="Strategy (W3929); new AI use-case; regulatory change">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3930_Flow10</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3930_Task4" name="AI Governance/Risk/Legal author the AI/ML policy and standards…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AI Governance/Risk/Legal author the AI/ML policy and standards: acceptable/prohibited AI uses, data-use rules, fairness/non-discrimination, human-oversight requirements, explainability thresholds, GenAI acceptable-use, and risk appetite (tolerable bias, error, autonomy by tier)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Risk / Legal / Privacy
Accountable (A): CIO / Head of Internal Audit &amp; Risk
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3930_Flow10</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3930_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3930_Task5" name="AI Governance/HR publish AI acceptable-use for employees (GenAI tools…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AI Governance/HR publish AI acceptable-use for employees (GenAI tools, data-input rules, confidentiality, IP — links to VS-19.4 training), and enforce via access and monitoring (links to VS-27.3)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / HR / Security
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Annual</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3930_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3930_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W3930_Task6" name="AI Governance/Compliance align policy to RA 10173 (automated…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: AI Governance/Compliance align policy to RA 10173 (automated decisions/profiling — links to VS-91), Consumer Act (links to VS-22), sector expectations, and monitor emerging PH AI regulation (links to W3944)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Compliance / Privacy
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Continuous</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3930_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3930_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W3930_End7" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W3930_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W3930_Annotation8">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-147 (ensure AI model risk &amp; human-oversight control.) | - operational: acceptable-use policy and monitoring (links to VS-27); operational: annual + on-change refresh
Owner: AI Governance / Risk / Legal</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W3930_Assoc9" sourceRef="W3930_Annotation8" targetRef="W3930_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3930_Flow10" sourceRef="W3930_Start3" targetRef="W3930_Task4" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3930_Flow11" sourceRef="W3930_Task4" targetRef="W3930_Task5" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3930_Flow12" sourceRef="W3930_Task5" targetRef="W3930_Task6" />
      <bpmn:sequenceFlow id="W3930_Flow13" sourceRef="W3930_Task6" targetRef="W3930_End7" />
    </bpmn:process>
    <bpmndi:BPMNDiagram id="W3930_diag">
      <bpmndi:BPMNPlane id="W3930_plane" bpmnElement="W_W3930">
        <bpmndi:BPMNShape id="W3930_Lane1_di" bpmnElement="W3930_Lane1" isHorizontal="true"><dc:Bounds x="160" y="80" width="950" height="170" /></bpmndi:BPMNShape>
