Owner: AI Governance / CIO
Participants: AI Governance, CIO, Data Science (links to VS-30.2), business AI owners, Model Risk (links to VS-21), Internal Audit (links to VS-21), IT/Security (links to VS-27), Privacy (links to VS-91), HR (links to VS-19)
