        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: AI Governance/Procurement/Legal assess and contract AI vendors, open-source models, and foundation-model/LLM providers: data-processing terms (RA 10173 links to VS-91), IP/output ownership, model-card/transparency, security review (links to VS-27.3), and ABC-compliant sourcing (links to VS-86.3)
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Procurement / Legal
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
