        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: AI Governance/Security govern vendor AI risk: data egress (customer/PII to vendor models), model provenance/poisoning for open-source, vendor model-change/refresh impact, and concentration risk on a single foundation model
Responsible (R): AI Governance / Security / Privacy
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Per vendor</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3934_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3934_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
