Responsible (R): AI Governance / IT
Accountable (A): AI Governance Lead
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W3934_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W3934_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
